# `device.window_list`

Enumerate window actors the daemon knows about (actor id, space, pid, live).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.space.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`DeviceWindowListResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `windows` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
